{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13204070","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13204070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1320407001:0":{"text":"フーキンさん！最近忙しいですか？実はあなたに作ってほしい物があるんです！","source_cn":"呼金，你最近有空吗？我们想拜托你制造一样物品~","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B29AB266AA9D4AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320407002:0":{"text":"よほっ、こいつはいいタイミングだ！ちょうど何か面白いことはないか聞きに行こうと思ってたんだよ！","source_cn":"嚯，还有这么巧的事！我正打算问问你们有什么好想法呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8AD37BA4A5DC206","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320407003:1":{"text":"ヨハンに氷像作りを手伝わされてからというもの、どうも脳みそまで凍ってしまったようでな。いいアイデアがまったく思い浮かばないんだ！","source_cn":"自打被老约恩抓去雕刻冰雕后，总感觉我的脑子好像被冻僵了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x154F53EA225DDB5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320407004:0":{"text":"したっけ、ここはウチが説明するよ。","source_cn":"由我来说吧，这样更清楚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6EA4F298F5F19FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320407005:0":{"text":"実は今、うちの新しい温泉を開拓しようと思ってね。でも効率的に野湯を見つける方法がなくて、アンタに温泉を探知できる機械を作ってほしいのさ。","source_cn":"我们白熊温泉旅店想开辟一些野温泉，但没办法很快确定它们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1E249480DA1509A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320407006:0":{"text":"ふむ……探知機を作るのは難しくないが、問題はどうやって温泉を特定するかだ。","source_cn":"让我想想……探测机器不难做，难的是通过什么来确定周围有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x243161D3F91D6CEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320407007:0":{"text":"探知には数値化されたデータが必要だからな。","source_cn":"要是没有能量化的数据，这事就做不成。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2D85B66FE7D410D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320407008:0":{"text":"うーん……","source_cn":"唔……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98211B84872E7893","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320407009:0":{"text":"温度差を基準にするのはどうだい？温泉がある場所の地面は温度が高くなってるはずだから、それを測定できればいけるんじゃないかい？","source_cn":"如果以温差作为标准，探测这片地区哪里温差比较大呢？有温...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31F0C653AF2B45F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320407010:0":{"text":"むむ……そいつはいい考えだ！","source_cn":"喔……这倒是可以！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCE5535B5EB073BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320407011:0":{"text":"ガルダさんって何でもすぐ行動に移せるだけでなく、機転も早いんですね！","source_cn":"哇！格尔达女士看着像是直爽的行动派，没想到居然这么有想法！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E4DF2251C0DFF6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320407012:0":{"text":"ふふ、旅館の経営は思うほど簡単じゃないのさ。","source_cn":"亲爱的，经营一家旅馆可不像听上去那么容易哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E0DCB86F83F01C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320407013:0":{"text":"旅館がうまくいってるのも、店舗を増やせるのも、頭をしっかり使ってきたからだべ！","source_cn":"如果我不肯动脑子，白熊温泉旅店也不可能有今天，更别提扩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11E8823ABABE8939","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320407014:0":{"text":"よほっ！店舗を増やすのか？","source_cn":"哦嚯！你们旅店要扩张？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D31C71E02824D77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1320407015:0":{"text":"そうですね。最近はお客さんで賑わっています。そろそろ温泉を増やさないと、足の踏み場もなくなってしまいそうです。","source_cn":"是啊，现在旅店的温泉里都是人！要是再没有新温泉的话，恐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2EDB982F0A00BCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1320407016:0":{"text":"そういうことなら、装置の製作費だ